        <div class="re-faq">
          <div class="re-faq-item"><h3>1. How much does sales enablement cost for a real estate developer in Andheri + Powai?</h3><div>Typical monthly spend for Andheri + Powai + Jogeshwari (Rs 1.5-8 crore (mid-premium)) projects: Starter Rs 50,000-1,00,000/month (solo developer, single project, 1 paid channel), Growth Rs 1-2.5 lakh/month (2-5 projects, full paid stack + CRM + inside-sales support), Premium Rs 2.5-5 lakh/month (multi-project established developer, NRI campaigns + PR + branding). Ad spend separate + transparent pass-through from Meta + Google.</div></div>
          <div class="re-faq-item"><h3>2. What ROAS can we expect from sales enablement in Andheri + Powai?</h3><div>Realistic ROAS benchmarks for Andheri + Powai developers (Rs 1.5-8 crore (mid-premium)): mid-ticket projects (sub Rs 1.5Cr) target 6-12x ROAS at CPL Rs 2,000-5,000. Premium projects (Rs 2-10Cr) target 8-20x ROAS at CPL Rs 5,000-15,000. Luxury (Rs 10Cr+) target 10-25x ROAS at CPL Rs 15,000-40,000. Caveat: real estate ROAS is calculated per booking + revenue, not per click.</div></div>
          <div class="re-faq-item"><h3>3. How is Sales + CRM Enablement Agency different in Andheri + Powai vs other Mumbai areas?</h3><div>Andheri + Powai + Jogeshwari buyer profile (IT + media pros, young families, tech + startup founders, airport-proximity buyers) requires sales enablement tuned for ticket band Rs 1.5-8 crore (mid-premium) + specific decision triggers. Key differences: creative aesthetic (lifestyle visuals for luxury, functional for mid-market), channel mix (YouTube + print for premium, Instagram + CTWA for mid-market), decision-maker (spouse joint-decision for family buyers, decision-maker-only for luxury), and timeline (longer research cycle for premium).</div></div>
          <div class="re-faq-item"><h3>4. Which project types work best for sales enablement in Andheri + Powai?</h3><div>Andheri + Powai + Jogeshwari (Rs 1.5-8 crore (mid-premium)) typically serves: Andheri East + West, Lokhandwala, 7 Bungalows, Oshiwara, Jogeshwari, Powai, Chandivali, Hiranandani Gardens. Sales team enablement + crm + inside-sales ops + closing-rate optimisation + post-booking nurture works best for pre-launched + newly-launched projects with 30-120 unit absorption horizon. Launched + sold-80%+ projects need inventory-clearing strategies (see our inventory-clearing playbook). Re-sale + ready-to-move inventory has different channel mix (more Housing + 99acres + MagicBricks + less Meta).</div></div>
          <div class="re-faq-item"><h3>5. How long does sales enablement take to show results for Andheri + Powai projects?</h3><div>Realistic maturity curve for Andheri + Powai + Jogeshwari (Rs 1.5-8 crore (mid-premium)): Week 1-3 = foundation + first campaigns live. Week 4-8 = first stable lead-flow + CPL baselines. Month 3-4 = first site-visits + bookings pattern lock. Month 5-6 = compounding retargeting + brand-search lift. Month 6+ = predictable monthly booking pipeline. Pre-launch campaigns deliver EOIs within 30-60 days + launch bookings in Month 2-3.</div></div>
          <div class="re-faq-item"><h3>6. Can you handle sales enablement for multiple projects simultaneously in Andheri + Powai?</h3><div>Yes — ITD manages sales enablement for 10+ real estate developers across Mumbai + Navi Mumbai + Thane with 20+ active projects. Multi-project operations include: separate ad accounts per project, project-specific landing pages, consolidated CRM + lead distribution, cross-project retargeting + nurture, shared creative studio, and monthly multi-project QBR. See our <a href="/services/performance-marketing-for-real-estate-developers.php">performance marketing for real estate developers</a> page for pricing.</div></div>
          <div class="re-faq-item"><h3>7. What&#x27;s the role of RERA + MahaRERA in sales enablement compliance for Andheri + Powai?</h3><div>MahaRERA registration is mandatory for all Andheri + Powai + Jogeshwari projects before any marketing. Sales + CRM Enablement Agency compliance checklist: (1) RERA number displayed on every ad creative + landing page + collateral, (2) no 'guaranteed' price appreciation claims, (3) no misleading possession-date claims, (4) carpet-area disclosure (not super-built-up only), (5) amenity claims match sanctioned plans. ITD reviews every creative against MahaRERA 2017 + 2023 amendments.</div></div>
          <div class="re-faq-item"><h3>8. Do you have real estate case studies for Andheri + Powai?</h3><div>ITD manages real estate marketing for 10+ developers across Mumbai + Navi Mumbai + Thane, including projects in Andheri + Powai + Jogeshwari ticket band Rs 1.5-8 crore (mid-premium). Live case studies + verified attribution data (lead-to-site-visit + site-visit-to-booking + booking-to-closing) shared under NDA on discovery call. Specific developer names anonymized publicly for client confidentiality.</div></div>
          <div class="re-faq-item"><h3>9. How do you handle NRI buyer campaigns for Andheri + Powai projects?</h3><div>NRI campaigns for Andheri + Powai (Rs 1.5-8 crore (mid-premium) typical NRI appeal) require: (1) GCC + UK + USA + Singapore + Canada audience targeting, (2) Arabic + regional-language creative where relevant, (3) virtual walkthrough + video-call site visits, (4) NRI financing + loan partner tie-ups (ICICI NRI, HDFC NRI, Axis NRI), (5) GCC event activations in Dubai + Riyadh + Doha. Andheri + Powai ultra-luxury (Rs 1.5-8 crore (mid-premium)) typically sees 25-50% NRI absorption.</div></div>
          <div class="re-faq-item"><h3>10. What is a reasonable broker commission structure for Andheri + Powai projects?</h3><div>Standard channel partner commission in Andheri + Powai + Jogeshwari (Rs 1.5-8 crore (mid-premium)): mid-market 1.5-2% of booking value, premium 1-2%, luxury 1-1.5% + performance bonuses on launch-month sales. ITD's role: not direct broker — we drive owned-channel leads + support channel partner marketing enablement (collateral + MLS feeds + co-branded campaigns + leaderboards). Combined owned + broker channels typically deliver 60-70% + 30-40% of total absorption.</div></div>
          <div class="re-faq-item"><h3>11. Can sales enablement work for small Andheri + Powai developers (1-2 projects)?</h3><div>Yes — Starter tier (Rs 50-1L/month retainer + Rs 50K-2L/month ad spend) is designed for solo + small developers with 1-2 active projects in Andheri + Powai (Rs 1.5-8 crore (mid-premium)). Core deliverables: GMB + Google Search + Meta Advantage+ + landing pages + WhatsApp CTWA + CRM. Scaled-down version of full-stack playbook. Many Starter clients graduate to Growth tier within 6-12 months as they launch next project.</div></div>
